Parts of this project re-declare the LV2 C interface (struct layouts, function
signatures and URI strings) so that it builds without the LV2 SDK. Those
declarations follow the LV2 headers, which are under the ISC license:

  src/lv2_abi.h             follows lv2/core/lv2.h
  src/ui/ui_lv2.c           the "LV2 UI ABI" block follows lv2/ui/ui.h
  tests/test_host.c         the LV2_Descriptor declaration follows lv2/core/lv2.h
  tests/ui_check.c          the UI descriptor declaration follows lv2/ui/ui.h
  tests/lilv_check.c        the plugin descriptor declaration follows lv2/core/lv2.h

